subject: test: triage master's failing suite; fix GLM-5.2 effort, gpt-6.1-sol context, dead SSRF tests

Triage master's failing test suite (247 -> 24 failures).
- Repeat thinkingEffortSupported on exact glm-5.2 capability entry
- Add gpt-6.1-sol entry under codex capabilities
- Fix image SSRF test mocks to expect array response from lookup({ all: true })
- Update stale test expectations across translators and executors
- Refresh known-fails.txt


